     1	//! An audio segment's automation (road map "audio" AP8b, spec §7.2, §11
     2	//! AU-85): the tap's settings as the clip's actions move them, published in
     3	//! the plan as points the app interpolates between.
     4	//!
     5	//! The envelope (`audio.rs`) already carries volume, the fades, the duck
     6	//! and every silencing as ramps. What the tap runs — the pan, the fold, the
     7	//! channel pick, the EQ and hum, noise reduction, the gate, the de-esser,
     8	//! the compressor, the limiter, isolation's Amount and the leveller (AU-66,
     9	//! the twelfth key) — is read off
    10	//! [`TAP_KEYS`] here instead. Evaluation stays the core's: each point is
